        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Three Days of Rain, Columbo\n- People: Michael Meredith, Peter Falk\n- Roles: Lieutenant Columbo\n- Awards: Primetime Emmy Awards, Golden Globe Award\n\nFacts:\n- Peter Falk was born on September 16, 1927, and died on June 23, 2011.\n- Three Days of Rain is a 2002 American film directed by Michael Meredith.\n- Columbo was a long-running television series that ran from 1968 to 2003.\n- Peter Falk was an American actor best known for playing Lieutenant Columbo in Columbo.\n- Peter Falk received four Primetime Emmy Awards and one Golden Globe Award for Columbo.",
